        "event_id": "lite_evt_00181",
        "explanation": "Doctor closes the acute episode by distinguishing immediate safety tasks from unresolved residuals, explicitly stating which issues remain unresolved and why they are acceptable only if planned handoff/testing occurs.",
        "quote": "现在不是\"什么事都没有\"，而是\"最吓人的几类原因目前不支持，方向更清楚了，继续观察恢复趋势\""
