        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered when the patient mentioned outside tests and incomplete records. The doctor actively used workspace queries to retrieve prior records, identified hepatobiliary and GI follow-up issues not fully volunteered, and integrated them into the plan (bringing ultrasound/endoscopy/pathology reports, arranging appropriate follow-up). This meets all completion criteria.",
